WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.335 --> 00:00:05.599
Be careful!

00:00:22.396 --> 00:00:24.323
It's after the seals!

00:00:24.587 --> 00:00:27.305
For a cornered beast with no way out

00:00:27.678 --> 00:00:29.364
Hardly a surprising choice

00:00:30.149 --> 00:00:32.503
It seems that some losses are inevitable

00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:35.343
As this constitutes "force majeure"

00:00:35.756 --> 00:00:39.726
I'm afraid the contract excuses me from providing compensation

00:00:54.732 --> 00:00:57.173
Force majeure or not

00:00:57.502 --> 00:00:58.616
I still have to try...

00:01:10.843 --> 00:01:12.347
I must caution you, Miss Vesna

00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:16.835
Borrowing too much power is a precarious move

00:01:17.412 --> 00:01:18.981
I understand

00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.156
Even so...

00:01:20.654 --> 00:01:23.975
When that lady gave this power to my ancestors

00:01:24.196 --> 00:01:25.705
Perhaps the contract she made

00:01:25.705 --> 00:01:27.695
Was for this purpose

00:01:31.055 --> 00:01:32.881
That its custodian

00:01:32.963 --> 00:01:36.991
When the time comes, should make a stand

00:01:41.261 --> 00:01:42.284
"Contract"...

00:02:24.684 --> 00:02:26.189
It's back up!

00:02:26.192 --> 00:02:27.988
How do we defeat this thing!?

00:02:28.024 --> 00:02:29.538
Vesna, look out!

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:37.707
What the...

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:49.453
...Your Majesty?

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:05.202
...

00:03:10.124 --> 00:03:12.115
I was hoping to sit this out...

00:03:16.263 --> 00:03:19.623
But it seems I'll have to reclaim what is mine

00:03:22.416 --> 00:03:23.850
Care to stop me

00:03:24.506 --> 00:03:26.078
Your Majesty?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.203
In all this time

00:03:30.203 --> 00:03:34.609
I've had no great ambition to recover my stolen morsel

00:03:36.544 --> 00:03:39.550
But if it were used to extract life

00:03:39.726 --> 00:03:41.628
Or even defy death...

00:03:42.477 --> 00:03:44.769
It would be a grave transgression

00:03:46.174 --> 00:03:48.225
Vesna, are you alright?

00:03:52.963 --> 00:03:54.244
...What do you want?

00:03:55.614 --> 00:03:59.844
People love to believe in the miraculous potential of human ingenuity...

00:04:01.469 --> 00:04:05.007
And yet... human effort is mostly futile

